  "mapping": {
    "authored_date": "2026-07-18",
    "deviation_notes": "The channel-gather-then-release-beam identity lands cleanly: beam_channel geometry + native accumulator-discharge (stage-build via on-hit-dealt, fire at 10-stage cap) + tick-cost channel + shock->sunder. Minor drift: the beam's fixed-length-immune-to-area-mods property and the secondary on-release damage-bubble are behavioral details the geometry enum doesn't separately model. A player keeps the full gather-then-lance rhythm; only the beam's area-scaling-immunity nuance is generalized.",
    "grade": "CLOSE",
    "kit_id": "poe1-divine-ire",
    "mapping_json": {
      "fidelity_notes": "GATHER-THEN-LANCE channel-beam: channel to accumulate stages by zapping nearby enemies, release a screen-length beam (dossier skill_loop). NATIVE mapping on two lanes: (1) beam_channel geometry (§6 beam/ray/channel) is exact; (2) the stage-accumulation-then-release IS the accumulator-discharge primitive (charge_stack_sub_shape=accumulator, fill on-hit-dealt = the channel zaps, discharge_threshold=10 = the 10-stage cap; verified engine enum). Channel-maintain = persistent_condition_shape=tick-cost (mana-per-tick, probe economy). shock->sunder (false-friend §2; probe control lists 'shock' as a rider). T4 TEMPORAL_CHARGE (stage/charge engine) + ELEMENTAL_ECHO (mono-lightning amp). CAPSTONE ABSTAINED — t4 routed from core identity (stage-charge-then-release engine) + probe (mana-spend + shock-rider) per fallback. Minor: the beam's 'fixed length, cannot be area-scaled' + the on-release damage bubble are behavioral properties beam_channel doesn't separately carry; the dominant loop (channel->beam) leads per §7.2.",
      "motion_frame": "gather-then-lance channeler: root in place, channel to zap nearby and build up to 10 stages, release a screen-length lightning beam that annihilates the lane",
      "option_c_substrate_flags": null,
      "resource_economy": {
